SPEC = {'setting': 'Warm Miyazaki-inspired hand-painted Japanese animation food illustration. Honey wood and ivory ceramics. Soft cel shading, no photorealism, no diagrams, no text. No hands.', 'steps': ['Two raw coral-orange salmon portions with fine pale fat lines, each about 25 mm thick, in a transparent heat-rated vacuum pouch in one layer with a small amount olive oil. Pouch flat on wooden counter, pin-bone tweezers and ruler-like blank strip beside it but NO numbers or text. No herbs in pouch, no lemon, no hands.', 'Clear water bath, black immersion circulator, one clear heat-rated bag completely submerged with two orange salmon portions side by side in a single layer. Salmon becoming evenly opaque coral, no browned crust yet. Pouch mouth sealed, no trapped big air bubbles. No readable numbers or text, no hands.', 'Two delicately cooked orange salmon portions skin-side down in a black frying pan with thin oil sheen. Skin edges becoming crisp, flesh stays intact and moist, very thin opaque pale-coral surface. Fish spatula rests under one edge, handle exits frame, no hands. No brown sear on top flesh, no raw centre exposed.', 'Finished sous-vide salmon portion on an ivory plate, delicate moist coral flakes edge-to-edge, crispy dark-golden skin along lower edge. A small flake separated by resting fork shows silky interior. One lemon wedge and dill sprig beside fish, not a salad. No raw-looking red centre, no hands.'], 'hero': 'Finished sous-vide salmon portion on an ivory plate, delicate moist coral flakes edge-to-edge, crispy dark-golden skin along lower edge. A small flake separated by resting fork shows silky interior. One lemon wedge and dill sprig beside fish, not a salad. No raw-looking red centre, no hands.', 'mise': []}
